+
+## Second batch
+
+4. Percentage coupons apply to the subtotal after volume discounts, not to the gross amount (12 × €5.00 with 10% coupon → €48.60) — `priceOrder`.
+5. A coupon is valid on its last day (`validUntil` is inclusive) — `Coupons.redeemable` used `>=`.
+6. Not changed: VAT on shipping. README says shipping is subject to 22% VAT and the README wins; a change needs a business/legal decision.
+
+Tests: test/coupons.test.ts.
